FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ogre, vil ogre, rentre chez toi !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Et qu'à la peur succède la joie !{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Ha ha !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Spirito malvagio, fuera de aquí!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Que venga la fortuna!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Ah ah ah!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bunu hep yapmak istemiştim{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Gerçi doğruyu söylemek {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
gerekirse oni olmayı daha çok
merak ediyorum. Biraz tuhaf, biliyorum.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Meno male che c'eri tu,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} se no non
avrei potuto neanche tirare un po'
di fagioli in giro, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}No está bien lanciare fagioli{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
se manca lo spirito malvagio, sai{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡Tengo muchas ganas de arrojar
habichuelas por ahí,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ojalá hubiera un ogro{{TAG:0003:001C:}}
al que lanzárselas.

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Anda, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}tienes habichuelas!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ni se te ocurra{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} tirármelas a mí,
¿vale?
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Cuando veas un ogro, lánzaselas{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
y di: "¡Afuera el mal!"{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}. 
Esa es la frase mágica.

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Oye, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} ¿vas a participar{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}
en nuestra olimpiada de lanzamiento
de habichuela?

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Qué casualidad, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
¡Los dos tenemos habichuelas!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ahora solo nos falta un ogro.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Todo bien?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Non ti sarai mica stufat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} di farti
tirare addosso tutti quei fagioli?
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}No te preocupes!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Io sono dalla tua parte.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Just like the rumors said,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} you've got
a pretty wild-looking face there!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Aunque parezcas un ogro, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:002C:}}no puedes
ir tirando habichuelas al tuntún por
